{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A4UserV17organizationLevelSbvp","title":"organizationLevel","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"organizationLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this is an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"organization-level"}]},{"type":"text","text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2)."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"organizationLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Such a principal’s record lives in its organization’s reserved tenant, so its global"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grants apply in every tenant of that organization, and it can act on a different one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by sending a different "},{"code":"X-Axiam-Tenant","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the next request — no re-login, because it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already is a principal of every tenant there."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An ordinary tenant principal is a principal of exactly one tenant; the same header","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change produces a ","type":"text"},{"code":"403","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for it. This flag is therefore what an application checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" offering a tenant switch, rather than discovering the answer from a failed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Derived, never asserted","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§5.2 rule 2): resolved server-side from the caller’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tenant record, and never sent by this SDK. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" when the login response omits it —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is what a server older than contract 1.31 answers — and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" on the guard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path, where this value is built from token claims that do not carry it. Both are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"safe direction: the application then offers no cross-tenant action."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since contract 1.35 that reach can be narrowed per assignment, so this flag alone no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"longer decides what to offer: consult "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" as well (§5.2.3 rule 3)."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser/reachableTenantIDs":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tenants this caller’s roles reach, when they are narrowed (§5.2.3)."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reachableTenantIDs"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"title":"reachableTenantIDs","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/reachabletenantids","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser":{"title":"AxiamUser","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An authenticated AXIAM identity.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser/organizationLevel":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this is an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"organization-level","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2)."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"organizationLevel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"title":"organizationLevel","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel","role":"symbol"}}}